A '''kodai (+)''' is a combat potion that boosts the player's [[Magic]] level by 6 + 16% of their base level. It can be made with 70 [[Herblore]] by using a [[golpar]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having [[endarkened juice]] in the inventory. Making this potion gives 13 Herblore experience.

This potion is the strong variant of the kodai potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. As a consequence, it does not help in casting [[enchantment spells]].

==Effects==
Magic boost is calculated with: <math>\lfloor MagicLevel \times \frac{16}{100} \rfloor + 6</math>
